# ORCA backend — environment template.
#
# The backend reads the REPOSITORY ROOT `.env`, not this directory's. This file
# documents the keys the backend actually consumes; copy the root template:
#   cp ../.env.example ../.env
#
# Keys used by the backend today:
#   OPEN_METEO_MARINE_URL     no key required
#   OPEN_METEO_FORECAST_URL   no key required
#
# Keys consumed once Phase 4 and Phase 6 land:
#   DATABASE_URL              PostGIS connection
#   SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
#   GEMINI_API_KEY / GEMINI_MODEL
